    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="59">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 59</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Be ðam þe on cynincges hirde feohteð. Gyf hwa on kynincges hirede gefeohte, ðolie ðæs liues, buton him se kynincg geárian wylle.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Concerning those who fight at the king's Court. If anyone fights at the king's Court, he shall lose his life, unless the king is willing to pardon him.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif hwa on ciningces hirede gefeohte, þolige þæs lifes, butan se cingc him gearian wylle.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
